🔹 When SHOULD you use intern()?

 ✅ Good use cases
* Large number of duplicate strings
* Memory optimization in high-scale systems
* Parsing heavy text (logs, tokens, keywords)

 ❌ Avoid when
* Strings are mostly unique
* Uncontrolled user input
* Memory pressure is high

